  "releaseNotes": "Initial stable release.\n\t\t  - Unified serialization abstraction\n\t\t  - JSON serializer\n\t\t  - MessagePack serializer\n\t\t  - Protocol Buffers serializer\n\t\t  - Dependency Injection integration\n\t\t  1.2.4: Dependency refresh. MessagePack 3.1.8 to 3.1.12 (clears Moderate advisory GHSA-qhrr-8q5h-9q3h); protobuf-net and protobuf-net.Core 3.2.56 to 3.4.30. No code or API changes.\n\t\t  1.3.0: Targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0. No public API or behavior change; the net9.0 and net10.0 assets are new, and the net8.0 asset and its declared dependencies are unchanged.\n\t\t  1.3.1: Dependency refresh. protobuf-net and protobuf-net.Core 3.4.30 to 3.4.40. No code or API changes.",
